Question data licence
=====================

Questions imported from the Open Trivia Database (https://opentdb.com) are
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
licence (CC BY-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Changes made on import (src/data/opentdb.ts): text decoded and whitespace
normalised, answer options shuffled, a short "teaser" (the opening words)
added, and records that were too long or malformed left out.

Questions written for Call It (the samples in src/data/sampleQuestions.ts and
any data/questions/*.callit.json files) are also released under CC BY-SA 4.0,
so the whole question set can be shared under one licence.

The app's source code is under the MIT licence (see LICENSE in the repository root).
